ring-stress-hang: bound a ring thread's idle wait, count the replies it strands, and report
ring entries userspace holds too long, for fuser 0.18.0 (vendor/fuser/CONSTELLATION-PATCH.md,
"The ring's idle wait"). Apply with -p1 in vendor/fuser, after 0003-interrupt.patch.

